{"title":"Mummy","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 46 Mummy that attacks with crush (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">slash</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 15% damage (the game's own rule). Monsters have no resistances.</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 11 times (2.6% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 5× XP and 5× loot.</p>\n      <p class=\"s\">Special: reviveHpFraction: .25</p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/mummy\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/mummy?lv=44\">Lv 44 <span>467</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/mummy?lv=45\">Lv 45 <span>354</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/mummy?lv=46\">Lv 46 <span>427</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/mummy?lv=47\">Lv 47 <span>369</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/mummy?lv=48\">Lv 48 <span>129</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/mummy?lv=50\">Lv 50 <span>24</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/mummy?lv=44\" title=\"Pick level 44\"><td><b>44</b></td><td>233</td><td>28.7</td><td>2,200</td><td class=\"muted\">699 · 40.2 · 6,600</td><td>467</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Old%20Maw's%20Sands\">Old Maw&#39;s Sands</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/mummy?lv=45\" title=\"Pick level 45\"><td><b