ppings\" title=\"Burial Wrappings - in 50 of 65 looted corpses, 46 recorded drops, 78 total, 1–4 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/a8f1eee73d79eed6feb5.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Burial Wrappings</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.3<br>×1–4</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"stamina-potion-large\" title=\"Stamina Potion Large - in 6 of 65 looted corpses, 5 recorded drops, 5 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/7fdf25f5efb0344b88a4.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Stamina Potion Large</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/11<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"health-potion-large\" title=\"Health Potion Large - in 5 of 65 looted corpses, 5 recorded drops, 5 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/752437a6ecea30afa5ec.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Health Potion Large</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/13<br>×1</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+9 more\">+9 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link quest\" data-item=\"gold-arms\" title=\"Gold Arms - in 1 of 65 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop - Quest item: Nothing Gets Through\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/1bfa900da12b78a7ad8f.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"quest-tag\" title=\"Quest item\">Q</span><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Arms</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/65<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-torso\" title=\"Gold Torso - in 1 of 65 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/e7cc2b2b975d3b90d517.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Torso</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/65<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-ro